            "level": {
              "value": 4
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "Your flair keeps foes' attention, as your motions with your gun draw your foes into a deadly game. As you toy with them and performatively brandish your weapon, you build their tunnel vision, leaving them trapped in a perceptual gauntlet of your own making. Attempt a Performance check against the Will DC of a single target within your one-handed firearm's first range increment.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The target takes a –2 status penalty to attack rolls against creatures other than you until the beginning of your next turn.\n- **Success:** The target takes a –1 status penalty to attack rolls against creatures other than you until the beginning of your next turn."
            }
          }
        }
      ]
